OL,3,GNEWSARoad upgrade timeline almost
OL,4,Adoubled to nine years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to dual the A66 road, which
OL,7,Fruns across northern England linking
OL,8,FCumbria, County Durham and Yorkshire,
OL,9,Fhas had its timeline almost doubled.
OL,11,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) said
OL,12,Fwork between Penrith in Cumbria, and
OL,13,FScotch Corner in North Yorkshire will
OL,14,Fnow take nine years instead of the
OL,15,Finitial estimate of five.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
