OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARoad upgrade timeline almost
OL,4,Adoubled to nine years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the move boosted
OL,7,Faffordability, but Westmorland and
OL,8,FLonsdale MP Tim Farron said: "Inflation
OL,9,Fin construction is ahead of regular
OL,10,Finflation and so if you have nine
OL,11,Fyears' worth of materials to
OL,12,Fpurchase... that is certainly going to
OL,13,Fmake it more expensive."
OL,15,FPreviously the project was costed at
OL,16,F#1.3bn, but reports suggest the bill
OL,17,Fhas risen to #1.4bn.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
